{
  "id": "GEN.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Gen. 28",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Isaac called for Jacob and blessed him. Then he commanded him: \"Do not marry a Canaanite woman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go at once to Paddan Aram,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "to the house of your mother's father Bethuel. Take a wife for yourself there, from among the daughters of Laban, your mother's brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "May God Almighty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "bless you and make you fruitful and increase your numbers until you become a community of peoples.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "May he give you and your descendants the blessing given to Abraham, so that you may take possession of the land where you now reside as a foreigner, the land God gave to Abraham.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaac sent Jacob on his way, and he went to Paddan Aram, to Laban son of Bethuel the Aramean, the brother of Rebekah, who was the mother of Jacob and Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Esau learned that Isaac had blessed Jacob and had sent him to Paddan Aram to take a wife from there, and that when he blessed him he commanded him, \"Do not marry a Canaanite woman,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and that Jacob had obeyed his father and mother and had gone to Paddan Aram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau then realized how displeasing the Canaanite women were to his father Isaac;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so he went to Ishmael and married Mahalath, the sister of Nebaioth and daughter of Ishmael son of Abraham, in addition to the wives he already had.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jacob's Dream at Bethel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob left Beersheba and set out for Harran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he reached a certain place, he stopped for the night because the sun had set. Taking one of the stones there, he put it under his head and lay down to sleep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He had a dream in which he saw a stairway resting on the earth, with its top reaching to heaven, and the angels of God were ascending and descending on it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There above it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "stood the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.28.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he said: \"I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.28.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your father Abraham and the God of Isaac. I will give you and your descendants the land on which you are lying.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your descendants will be like the dust of the earth, and you will spread out to the west and to the east, to the north and to the south. All peoples on earth will be blessed through you and your offspring.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am with you and will watch over you wherever you go, and I will bring you back to this land. I will not leave you until I have done what I have promised you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jacob awoke from his sleep, he thought, \"Surely the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.28.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is in this place, and I was not aware of it.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was afraid and said, \"How awesome is this place! This is none other than the house of God; this is the gate of heaven.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Early the next morning Jacob took the stone he had placed under his head and set it up as a pillar and poured oil on top of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He called that place Bethel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "though the city used to be called Luz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob made a vow, saying, \"If God will be with me and will watch over me on this journey I am taking and will give me food to eat and clothes to wear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that I return safely to my father's household, then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.28.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will be my God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "this stone that I have set up as a pillar will be God's house, and of all that you give me I will give you a tenth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GEN.29",
    "number": "29",
    "bookId": "GEN"
  },
